            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine)\n\nWhen the moldering steed damages a living creature with its jaws Strike, the steed gains 20 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 minute, and the creature must succeed at a DC 38 Will save or become stupefied 1. Further damage dealt by the steed increases the creature's stupefied value on a failed save by 1, to a maximum of stupefied 4."
